{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Quels sont les 5 océans nommés sur la Terre ?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"Brr! This ocean is cold! How do those penguins stand it?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"Forget the peach pie and sweet tea: it doesn't get more southern than this ocean."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"Ironically, this ocean is located nowhere near India! Just kidding, it's, like, right next to India."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"And no, George Clooney's character from [i]Ocean's Eleven[/i] does not count."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio","s":"Did you type Danny Ocean even though I specifically told you not to? Humans. You'll never learn."}]}
